cff-version: 1.2.0
title: n64-video-interface-python
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Gustavo
    family-names: Franco
    alias: gufranco
repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/n64-video-interface-python
abstract: >-
  Reads and edits the video configuration of a Nintendo 64 ROM: the VI mode
  table that decides anti-aliasing, dithering, the divot filter and gamma, plus
  the run-time dedither request that never appears in the table. Reseals the
  header checksum so the result still boots, and refuses rather than guessing
  whenever it cannot prove the edit is correct.
keywords:
  - nintendo-64
  - video-interface
  - anti-aliasing
  - romhacking
  - preservation
license: MIT
